  "description": "Who knew that the game I designed for fun with my friend in middle school would later become a monster that would swallow up the entire world? \n\nTaejun, who has been living a tough life with his younger sister, loses all of what he saved due to a lease fraud. In despair, he curses, \"To hell with this fucking world!!\" while looking at Namsan... but the next day, the curse came true! \n\nNamsan suddenly turned into a large sinkhole where man hunting golems started endlessly spawning!! The world has turned into a living hell, but Taejun realizes that these golems may be a mob he created in the past? A strategy that only he knows of. Save the world, or save just yourself. \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
